 eyes show how hard they have been working to keep the peace in the dream. Do not disturb their rest.","abilities":["Attacks inflict Nervous Impairment.","Once awakened, gains increased Movement Speed, loses damage reduction effect, and temporarily increases ATK for all awakened <Clockwork Servants>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":7700,"atk":605,"def":450,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.2}},"slumber_companion_beast":{"slug":"slumber_companion_beast","name":"Slumber Companion Beast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Slumber Companion Beast.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Huge and strong companion beast in the neverwaking story that can float in mid-air. Sleeping on its fluffy back is considered the height of luxury in the Castle of Dreams, though its sense of direction has not gotten any better.","abilities":["Attacks inflict Nervous Impairment.","Carries any sleeping enemies or stunned Operators when passing through them, and puts them down after a while; taking up extra Block for the duration","Does not deduct Life Points when entering the Objective without carrying any units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":2,"stats":{"hp":17600,"atk":165,"def":500,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.3}},"morpheus":{"slug":"morpheus","name":"Morpheus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Morpheus.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Why would anyone want to escape the dream? Stay here, where everything is fun.","abilities":["Morpheus unleashes threads that can be blocked by your units; each unblocked thread increases Morpheus' ATK","First Form","[Binding Dream] Connects a thread to the furthest allied unit within Attack Range, dealing continuous Arts damage","[Dissociative Sensation] Connects to enemies with threads, causing most of the damage taken by Morpheus to be split among them","[Evolution of Dream] Morpheus summons and rides a 'Sleep Companion Beast', becomes unblockable, gains increased Movement Speed and Barrier; ends after some time has passed, or if the Barrier is destroyed","Second Form","When defeated for the first time, deals Arts damage to the whole field several times; when in 2nd form, Attack Range covers the entire field, and connects to all enemies with [Dissociative Sensation]","[Binding Dream] Causes your defeated units to be unable to retreat for a while","[Dissociative Sensation] Other enemies share more damage for Morpheus","[Evolution of Dream] Morpheus summons and rides a 'Background Clown' instead, and the increase in block cost is replaced with Low-Altitude Hovering"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":70000,"atk":700,"def":580,"res":35,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.8}},"dream_of_metamorphosis":{"slug":"dream_of_metamorphosis","name":"'Dream of Metamorphosis'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Dream of Metamorphosis'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Massive insect that has broken out from its cocoon hanging from branches that grew out of the clock. Having left the hard shell behind, it now dances in the air, weaving the most beautiful sight in the fairy tale. Who would be so cruel as to break this breathtaking beauty?","abilities":["Attacks hit five times, dealing Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":33000,"atk":150,"def":800,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.2}},"sleepwalking_butler":{"slug":"sleepwalking_butler","name":"Sleepwalking Butler","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sleepwalking Butler.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"mo